Z||000009||horseman||12-24-2000||11:47 PM||||Cool,<BR>Does the LeBra cover the license plate? Does it have the roll up feature(above headlights)? I haven't got mine in the mail yet.<BR>Thanks,<BR>Charlie||||reg||1
Z||000010||Motorhead||12-25-2000||02:41 AM||||LeBra has a flap that covers the license plate area if the plate holder is not present. It does not extend over the hood, so headlight flaps are not necessary.  Very clean look! Keep the paint finish clean and dry under the bra or discoloration of paint can occur! I only use mine for road trips to keep the bugs and rocks off the paint!<P>Mike||||reg||1
Z||000011||firstfiero||12-25-2000||08:17 AM||||    I need mine because I have a big hole right between my headlights  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">. It was covered over with fiberglass tape (all this done by the last owner).. but the tape doesn't match. It's a cheap fix for something that really bothers me. I'm more interested in putting some serious cash into the engine right now. 86se||||reg||1
